{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>In This Demo</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first 18 levels of\u00a0<strong><i>SwitchTrack</i></strong>, and begin to master the three unique track types included in this demo. Attempt to 3 star each included level and become master of the tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>About SwitchTrack:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of the rails</strong> in<i><strong> SwitchTrack</strong></i>, a frantic train management puzzle game. Use your levers to guide and direct the incoming mine carts to their destinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage The Tracks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916970/extras/4d5b65487fd0da2e40f2dea0cf7e9ac8.poster.avif?t=1758298444\" width=572 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916970/extras/4d5b65487fd0da2e40f2dea0cf7e9ac8.webm?t=1758298444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilise the different tracks</strong> and time your inputs well to avoid dangers and collect as much cargo as possible. Master each level's timings to maximise your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rails can get busy so you must keep an eye on multiple carts at once to ensure they all make it safely across each level. Some tracks are connected to the same input, so make sure it's the right decision before pulling that lever!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916970?t=1758298444","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916970/9282cc61d34ef1c6dcf8b9e33aaf6264396f1487/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758298444","capsule_image"